        (globalPooledLabelScale j*Ideal.absNorm q.1)^ε/(1+globalBinRadial ell Y j)^A *
      densityChildEnergy p hp hcop hg F (secondRayMinus Ψ ray) (secondRayPlus Ψ ray)
